# Everything the stack writes at runtime, not three of the four directories it writes to.
#
# data/media was missing: the program feed, thumbnails and rehearsal media accumulate there and sat
# in git status as twenty megabytes of untracked noise, one "git add ." away from being committed.
# It is the same content .dockerignore keeps out of images for the same reason.
